        "created_at": "2021-12-07T23:46:42.840Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My Near Mint involved a luckily timed Wrecking Uppercut throwing Judge Mental into the trash, as well as whittling Ambuscade down until his deck was empty. Glamour can’t come out to play if she’s in the trash! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=10\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
